<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN"
        "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"/>
</head>
<body>

<p>Dear $userName, </p>

<p>
    You are receiving the $receivedMessageCount of four consecutive notifications as your account $accountName is to expire
    in $daysCount days.
    Please note that the next notice will be sent $afterSendEmailDate away from expiration.
    <br/>
    You need to renew your subscription, please call GoodSystems on 1300 85 75 60 before $expireDate because after that your account will be automatically inactivated.
</p>

</body>
</html>